{"s1_army_second_guess_052","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=4,14|hour=20,1|mood=sad|world=vehicle,door,water",{1,"If we'd left Friday night like you wanted, we'd be over the river by now",2,"Or we'd be sitting in the car on the interstate with the doors locked",3,"We picked - that's all, we picked, and we're here, and it's too late to pick again",1,"I know, I just say it at night"}},
{"s1_bite_garage_ronnie_001","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=0,4|hour=16,5|mood=fear|world=road",{1,"Ronnie's been in the garage two hours now, he quit answering about twenty minutes ago",2,"He said leave him be, plain as day, I heard him",3,"He also said a dog got him, ain't a dog on this street would do a man's arm like that",1,"Somebody's got to go look",2,"Not tonight"}},
{"s1_bite_sleeve_002","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,10|mood=fear|world=building",{1,"You've had that sleeve pulled down since you walked in - it's ninety-four degrees",2,"I burn easy",1,"In a basement?",2,"Leave it, please - I'll say something if it turns into anything, okay?"}},
{"s1_bite_mutter_nail_003","any",1,"reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|day=0,14|mood=fear|world=fence,inside",{1,"It's a scratch, a nail sticking out of the fence, that's all that was",1,"Nail on the fence, rusty old nail on the fence",1,"Why is it so hot in here, though?"}},
{"s1_bite_mama_fever_004","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=0,5|mood=fear|world=vehicle,building",{1,"When Mama's fever broke, I thought it was good news",2,"I would have too",1,"She'd stopped breathing. That's how it broke",3,"I'm sorry. You don't have to tell me the rest just to explain why you're frightened"}},
{"s1_bite_boot_heel_005","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=2,14|mood=funny",{1,"One of 'em got my boot on the way in - chewed clean through the heel, hahaha!",2,"Did it get skin?",1,"Heel's fine, I'm pretty sure the heel's fine",2,"Take the boot off",1,"In a minute"}},
{"s1_bite_supper_talk_006","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|mood=grim",{1,"If it's ever me, you don't wait - you hear? You don't sit there holding my hand and talking",2,"Not at the supper table",1,"When would you like to have it, then? I'm asking nice",2,"Eat your beans"}},
{"s1_bite_arm_check_007","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,12|mood=calm",{1,"New rule, everybody shows their arms and legs before lights out - me included",2,"Like tick checks at Bible camp",3,"Ticks at my camp didn't get back up afterwards",2,"We had a counselor named Stu who might have",1,"Arms - now, both of you"}},
{"s1_bite_raccoon_story_008","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=0,4|hour=20,5|mood=angry|world=road",{1,"Carl Pruitt told half the street it was a raccoon that got his boy",2,"It was dark out, could have been a raccoon",1,"I watched that raccoon walk up his driveway on two legs wearing a Little League jersey"}},
{"s1_bite_bleach_cousin_009","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|hour=20,5",{1,"My cousin swears on bleach, pour it straight in the bite and it burns the sickness out",2,"Your cousin swears the moon landing was shot on a sound stage in Nevada",1,"So that's a no on the bleach",2,"That's an I don't know, nobody knows a damn thing, that's what gets me"}},
{"s1_bite_laundry_room_010","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=2,14|mood=grim|world=vehicle",{1,"What did you use? On Uncle Wayne?",2,"Don't",3,"He's asking so he knows what to do next time - he's not being ugly",2,"The tire iron, out in the laundry room so the little ones wouldn't hear - now can we please stop?"}},
{"s1_bite_mutter_mostfolks_011","any",1,"reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|mood=fear",{1,"Fourteen hours, fella on the scanner said most folks go inside a day",1,"Well, I never was most folks",1,"Heh - Mama used to say that like it was a bad thing"}},
{"s1_bite_teething_012","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|mood=sad|world=building",{1,"The baby bit me while I was changing him - he's teething, I near about screamed the house down",2,"Hey, hey, come here",1,"He's eight months old and for one second I looked at him like he was one of them",2,"Give him here, go sit on the porch a minute"}},
{"s1_bite_first_aid_013","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=0,10|mood=funny",{1,"Anybody here a nurse? A vet? Anybody ever taken so much as a first aid class?",2,"I did CPR at the YMCA in eighty-seven, on a plastic dummy with no arms",3,"That's more than I got",1,"Then you're the doctor - congratulations",2,"Just so you know, I never applied for it"}},
{"s1_bite_doorknob_014","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=1,12|mood=calm|world=building",{1,"Anybody gets scratched goes in the upstairs bathroom, it locks from the hall if you flip the knob around",2,"You already flipped the knob around",1,"Last night, while you were asleep",2,"Well, I'm glad one of us is thinking ahead, I guess"}},
{"s1_bite_hospital_line_015","any",2,"reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|day=0,4|mood=sad|world=vehicle",{1,"They took Ed up to the hospital in Louisville in the ambulance - lights and everything",2,"You heard from him since?",1,"The number just rings, I counted forty rings last night before I hung up",2,"They're probably swamped up there",1,"Probably"}},
{"s1_bite_shirt_blood_016","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=0,14|mood=fear|world=building",{1,"Whose blood is that down your shirt?",2,"Not mine",1,"You sure about that?",2,"Checked twice in the gas station bathroom in Ekron, then a third time - it's not mine"}},
{"s1_bite_dog_leg_017","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=0,10|mood=fear|world=building",{1,"Buster's got a bite on his back leg, from the thing in the Hobbs' yard",2,"Does it take in dogs? Does it?",1,"I don't know, he's up under the porch, licking at it",2,"Keep the kids out from under there till we know"}},
{"s1_bite_wrist_grip_018","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|mood=funny",{1,"Fella I pulled out of that wreck on 31W grabbed my wrist so tight - hahaha, real tight, like a handshake at church",2,"Did he break the skin?",1,"You know, I keep meaning to look"}},
{"s1_bite_through_wall_019","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=0,10|hour=22,5|mood=fear|world=building",{1,"You awake?",2,"Yeah",1,"Papaw's making that noise again, through the wall",2,"He snores, he's snored my whole life",1,"That's not snoring, just listen to it a second"}},
{"s1_bite_barber_magazine_020","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|mood=grim|world=building",{1,"I read where if you take the arm off fast enough it can't spread",2,"Read it where?",1,"One of them magazines down at the barber shop, with the aliens on the front",3,"Nobody in this house is losing an arm on account of the barber shop"}},
{"s1_bite_nightgown_021","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=2,10|hour=4,11|mood=sad",{1,"The Watkins girl was out by her mailbox again this morning - just standing",2,"In her nightgown?",1,"Same one as Saturday, the blood's all gone brown on it",2,"Close the curtain, hon"}},
{"s1_bite_mutter_cartoon_022","any",1,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=0,14|mood=sad",{1,"Got it cleaned out, whole bottle of peroxide",1,"Only bandages left in the house were the kids' ones with the cartoon puppies",1,"Looks real silly on a grown arm - real silly"}},
{"s1_bite_summer_cold_023","any",4,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|mood=angry|world=building",{1,"She's burning up, everybody in this room can see it",2,"It's a summer cold, she had the sniffles before she ever got here",3,"She have that mark on her calf before she got here too?",4,"Lower your voice, she's right in the next room",1,"Good, somebody oughta say it to her face"}},
{"s1_bite_shoelace_ring_024","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=2,14|mood=sad",{1,"I took Gary's ring off - before, after, I mean",2,"You don't have to tell me about it",1,"It's on a shoelace around my neck, it keeps snagging on everything"}},
{"s1_bite_glass_elbow_025","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=0,14|mood=calm",{1,"Hold still, it's window glass, it's not them",2,"You're positive it's glass?",1,"I watched you put your elbow through the pane, bite down on this dish towel",2,"Ow - Ow! Okay, yeah, that's glass"}},
{"s1_bite_answering_doc_026","any",3,"reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|day=1,6|mood=funny",{1,"TV said if you get flu-like symptoms, stay home and call your physician",2,"Called mine, got his answering machine",3,"What'd it say?",2,"Office closed for the Fourth, we'll reopen Tuesday, didn't say which one"}},
{"s1_bite_calendar_cat_027","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=1,10|mood=fear",{1,"It's a cat scratch - Jenny's cat got him last week, before any of this started",2,"Show me on the calendar",1,"What?",2,"You write everything on that calendar - show me",1,"Tuesday the sixth, right there in pencil - before",2,"God, I'm sorry I asked"}},
{"s1_bite_river_gate_028","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|hour=16,5|mood=sad|world=water",{1,"I'll head on out before dark, y'all don't need to do a thing",2,"Head out where?",1,"Down to the river, I reckon, always did like the river, just leave the back gate unlatched for me, if that's alright"}},
{"s1_bite_scared_sleep_029","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|hour=21,4|mood=fear",{1,"I don't want to fall asleep - what if I wake up and I'm not me anymore?",2,"Then you won't know about it",1,"That's not near as comforting as you think it is",2,"Wasn't trying to comfort you, I'm too tired to lie"}},
{"s1_bite_dispatcher_cry_030","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=0,2|mood=fear",{1,"I called the sheriff's office about Mr. Tate, lady said they'd send somebody out",2,"Did she say when?",1,"When they get to it, then she started crying right there on the phone and hung up on me"}},
{"s1_bite_horseshoe_031","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=2,14|mood=grim",{1,"A person's bite don't look like a dog's, it's the shape of it - like a little horseshoe",2,"How do you know that?",1,"I didn't, not until Friday"}},
{"s1_bite_daddy_upstairs_032","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=1,8|mood=angry|world=door,building",{1,"He's still Daddy in there, we keep him in the upstairs room and we wait for the Army doctors",2,"He tried to take your fingers off through the gap under the door!",1,"He's confused, that's all!",3,"Stop it, both of you, I'm nailing one more board over that door and that's all I'm deciding today"}},
{"s1_bite_mutter_milkjug_033","any",1,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|mood=funny",{1,"Held that lady's hand in the church lot trying to pull her up - cold as a milk jug, hahaha",1,"Cold hands, warm heart, that's what Mamaw always said",1,"I wonder what mine feel like right now"}},
{"s1_bite_slow_ones_034","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=2,14|mood=fear",{1,"It's been a day and a half since he got bit - he's still eating, still telling that joke about the rooster",2,"Maybe it don't take in some people",1,"Or maybe it takes its sweet time in some people",2,"Don't you say that where he can hear it"}},
{"s1_bite_dont_tell_mom_035","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|mood=fear",{1,"If I tell you something, you can't tell Mom - swear it",2,"Is this about the Carter boy?",1,"It's about my leg",2,"Pull up your jeans - right now"}},
{"s1_bite_recliner_036","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|hour=18,2|mood=fear|world=building",{1,"Whoever sleeps on the couch keeps the shotgun next to them tonight - on account of the fella in the recliner",2,"He's asleep, he's just sleeping",3,"He's been just sleeping since four o'clock this afternoon"}},
{"s1_bite_tetanus_037","any",2,"reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|mood=funny",{1,"When was your last tetanus shot?",2,"Nineteen seventy-nine, stepped on a rake at my brother-in-law's",1,"Well, there's one thing you won't be dying of"}},
{"s1_bite_take_me_instead_038","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|hour=20,4|mood=sad",{1,"I asked the Lord to pull it out of her and put it in me instead",2,"Don't pray like that",1,"Why not? It's the only useful thing I've done all day"}},
{"s1_bite_wash_hands_039","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|hour=4,11|mood=angry",{1,"Wash your hands before you touch the water jug, that's twice now I've watched you not",2,"I washed up this morning",1,"You also carried that man out by his ankles this morning",2,"Fine, fine! Where'd you hide the soap?"}},
{"s1_bite_hush_kids_040","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=1,10|mood=fear|world=vehicle,window,building",{1,"What do we tell the kids about Aunt Pam?",2,"That she went to stay at the hospital in Brandenburg",3,"Brandenburg? They can see her car in the side yard from the bedroom window",2,"Then we move the car"}},
{"s1_bite_bingo_041","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=0,6|mood=sad",{1,"First one I ever saw was Loretta from bingo night - she'd bit the caller",2,"Good Lord",1,"She always did say he called the numbers too fast - heh, she always said that",1,"Anyhow - you want the last of the crackers?"}},
{"s1_bite_whose_turn_042","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=3,14|hour=16,5|mood=grim",{1,"If Terry turns tonight, who does it?",2,"Not me, I've never so much as killed a chicken",3,"I'll do it",1,"You sure?",3,"No, but I said it first, so it's mine"}},
{"s1_bite_mutter_mirror_043","any",1,"reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|mood=fear",{1,"Eyes look alright - little red, everybody's eyes are red, nobody's sleeping",1,"Tongue's pink, that's good, I think - is that good?",1,"Stop it, put the mirror down and go do something"}},
{"s1_bite_quarantine_room_044","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=2,14|mood=calm|world=building",{1,"I remember offering to sit up with him in the sewing room",2,"What did the others say?",1,"Asked if I had something to defend myself. Like that was the only question",2,"I wish somebody had asked if there was a way out of that room"}},
{"s1_bite_rabies_theory_045","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=0,5",{1,"It's rabies, some new kind - that's why the biting and why they can't stand still",2,"Rabies doesn't get you back up once you're dead",1,"Some new kind, I said",3,"Could y'all argue about it quieter? I don't want anything hearing us"}},
{"s1_bite_hand_on_forehead_046","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|mood=warm",{1,"Come here, let me feel your head",2,"I'm fine, that's the third time today",1,"Fourth - humor me",2,"Fine, but then I check yours too"}},
{"s1_bite_cooler_ice_047","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,10|mood=fear",{1,"She keeps asking for ice, says her whole side's on fire",2,"There's a bag left in the cooler",1,"That's the last bag",2,"Give it to her anyway"}},
{"s1_bite_hidden_bandage_048","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=2,14|mood=angry",{1,"Found this in the trash, a gauze pad, all bloody - somebody here's hiding something",2,"That's mine, it's my monthly - you want to see that too?",1,"I, no - sorry - sorry, ma'am",3,"Real smooth, detective"}},
{"s1_bite_two_bites_049","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=2,14|mood=funny",{1,"Mosquitoes ate me alive last night, got a dozen bites on each leg",2,"You might want to phrase that different around here",1,"Right... bugs got me, just bugs"}},
{"s1_bite_puppet_050","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=3,14|mood=sad",{1,"Bobby wants to know if Grandpa gets a sucker at the hospital, like when Bobby got his tonsils out",2,"What'd you tell him?",1,"Grape, I told him Grandpa'd pick grape"}},
{"s1_bite_gloves_051","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|mood=calm",{1,"Dishwashing gloves - yellow ones - wear them any time you touch a body",2,"There's only one pair",3,"Then only one of us touches bodies",2,"Well I'm not volunteering, so don't look at me like that"}},
{"s1_bite_thermometer_052","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|mood=fear|world=building",{1,"Where's the thermometer? The glass one, not the ear thing",2,"Kitchen drawer with the batteries - who's it for?",1,"Just get it",2,"Who is it for?"}},
{"s1_bite_sister_note_053","any",1,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=2,14|mood=sad",{1,"Carol left a note on the counter before she walked out - says don't come looking",1,"Underneath that she wrote to thaw the pork chops for Sunday",1,"Freezer quit two days ago, Carol, they thawed on their own"}},
{"s1_c01_bathtub_ring_001","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=1,6|mood=funny",{1,"I filled the bathtub last night in case the water quits - who pulled the plug?",2,"Nobody pulled any plug",1,"Then why is it half gone, with a gray ring and a rubber duck floating in it?",3,"Your grandpa said a man can't face the end of the world with dirty feet"}},
{"s1_c01_freezer_feast_002","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=4,10|hour=4,11|mood=funny|world=window,road",{1,"I remember our freezer failing. Steaks, shrimp, a turkey we'd saved since Thanksgiving",2,"I worried about starting a grill. Didn't want it obvious we were having a feast",1,"We argued over how to cook it without advertising supper to everybody",3,"I was the fool talking about shrimp while we tried to make a plan"}},
{"s1_c01_marker_lines_003","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=3,14|mood=funny",{1,"Why are there marker lines drawn down the side of the powdered milk jug?",2,"Your sister did it, one line a day - today we're supposed to be on the third line",1,"It's already down under the fourth one",2,"Then somebody drank tomorrow, and somebody's got a white mustache"}},
{"s1_c01_poptart_mamaw_004","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh,seasoned|day=2,12|mood=funny|world=window",{1,"Somebody got into the Pop-Tarts in the night, the last foil pack",2,"Don't look at me, I was on the window till three",3,"It was me, I'm seventy-eight years old and I wanted a Pop-Tart",1,"Mama, those were for the kids",3,"The kids have got time to get another Pop-Tart, I was playing the odds"}},
{"s1_c01_bulletin_count_005","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=1,8|mood=calm|world=building",{1,"I wrote down every can in the pantry on the back of Sunday's church bulletin",2,"How long does it get us?",1,"Eleven days if nobody's greedy, nine if your brother stays",2,"He's staying",1,"I know, I already crossed out eleven"}},
{"s1_c01_water_heater_006","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=4,14|mood=calm|world=building",{1,"There's forty gallons of drinking water sitting in the basement and not one of us thought of it",2,"Where?",1,"The water heater, there's a little spigot on the bottom - put the stock pot under it",3,"It's coming out orange",1,"Let it run a minute - that's rust, it's not poison - I'm near about sure it's not poison"}},
{"s1_c01_back_tank_007","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=6,14|mood=funny",{1,"So we're drinking out of the toilet now, that's where we are",2,"The tank, the back tank - that water has never been anywhere near the bowl",1,"It's been near the bowl my whole life, it sits right on top of the bowl",2,"Boil it and quit talking to me like I invented plumbing"}},
{"s1_c01_dog_food_bag_008","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=3,14|mood=grim|world=building",{1,"Twenty pounds of dog food left in the bag - Rosie's the only one in this house who'll eat it",2,"So far",1,"Don't",2,"I'm just saying I read the bag, it's corn and meal - folks ate worse in the Depression",1,"Rosie eats her food, we eat ours, we're not that desperate yet"}},
{"s1_c01_ate_while_cooking_009","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=3,14|hour=16,5|mood=warm",{1,"Mom says she already ate while she was cooking, every single night she says that",2,"She does look full",1,"There's nothing to eat while you boil rice, I watched her tonight - she stirred it and she drank a glass of water",2,"Then tomorrow you do the rice, and you make her sit down at the table first"}},
{"s1_c01_laundromat_machine_010","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,8",{1,"Busted open the snack machine at the laundromat, oatmeal pies, peanuts, and four packs of the orange crackers",2,"Anybody see you do it?",3,"A lady folding towels, she's still in there folding towels, same towels, I think",1,"I gave her a pack of peanuts, she said thank you, hon, and kept on folding"}},
{"s1_c01_green_tomatoes_011","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=2,14|mood=calm|world=building",{1,"Tomatoes are still green, every last one of them, another two weeks, easy",2,"Mama used to fry green ones in cornmeal, we've got cornmeal",1,"We've got cornmeal and no oil",2,"Bacon grease can by the stove is near about full - your daddy never poured out a drop in his life"}},
{"s1_c01_iga_okra_012","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,5|mood=funny",{1,"IGA in {town} is stripped, bread, water, milk, batteries, all gone by noon Saturday",2,"Nothing left at all?",1,"Cake sprinkles, a whole shelf of pickled okra - and a bag of charcoal somebody dropped and busted open",3,"Well, pickled okra is a vegetable",1,"I got nine jars, nobody make that face at me"}},
{"s1_c01_needs_water_013","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=4,14|mood=grim|world=building",{1,"Funny how much food takes water first. Rice, macaroni, oatmeal, beans",2,"And what doesn't need water?",1,"Some of it makes you thirsty. I used to forget that when I was shopping",2,"So we'd have to think about both before calling a pantry full"}},
{"s1_c01_best_by_014","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=3,14",{1,"These cans from the church donation box say best by nineteen ninety",2,"Best by, it doesn't say dead by",3,"My cousin got so sick off a can of chili he missed his own wedding",2,"Was the can dented?",3,"I don't know, it was his second wedding, nobody asked",2,"This one's not dented, we eat the chili"}},
{"s1_c01_six_cigarettes_015","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=2,10|mood=funny|world=door",{1,"I'm down to six cigarettes, I'm telling everybody now so you know it's nothing personal later",2,"You could quit",1,"I quit in eighty-six - and eighty-nine, I am not quitting during this",2,"Then smoke 'em at the back door and blow it out through the screen"}},
{"s1_c01_instant_cold_016","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=5,14|hour=5,10|mood=funny|world=road",{1,"Instant coffee won't melt in cold water, it just floats around in little clumps",2,"Stir it",1,"I stirred it, it tastes like a wet parking lot",2,"Is it helping?",1,"Yeah - God help me, it's helping"}},
{"s1_c01_baby_peas_017","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=5,14|mood=funny|world=building",{1,"Who ate the baby's peas? The little jars?",2,"One, I had one jar - it's mostly water, I figured it counted as drinking",1,"She's got eleven jars of carrots left, and she spits carrots at the wall",2,"Then I'll eat the carrots too, so she doesn't have to look at 'em"}},
{"s1_c01_easter_sack_018","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=2,12|mood=warm|world=building",{1,"Found a sack of Easter candy up on the closet shelf - from April",2,"I hid that from the kids, I hid it so good I hid it from me",1,"Jelly beans, and a hollow chocolate bunny with the ears already gone",2,"I ate the ears in April, you don't tell them that part"}},
{"s1_c01_pool_flush_019","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=5,14|hour=4,11",{1,"The Varneys' above-ground pool is still full, twelve thousand gallons, the sticker says",2,"You're not drinking that, it's gone green on the steps",1,"Not drinking - Flushing, two buckets a flush",3,"Their gate's open, and there was something floating in the deep end this morning",1,"Then we flush a whole lot less"}},
{"s1_c01_rabbit_clover_020","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=5,14|mood=funny",{1,"How much meat you reckon is on a rabbit?",2,"Why are you asking me that?",1,"No reason",2,"Clover's a pet, she's got a name, she sleeps in a shoebox by Katie's bed",1,"I meant rabbits in general - wild ones, out in general",2,"Go say rabbits in general to Katie's face"}},
{"s1_c01_postage_scale_021","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=3,14|mood=calm",{1,"Are you weighing the peanut butter on the postage scale?",2,"Two ounces a person, it's fair, it's exact, and nobody gets to argue with a scale",1,"Twenty years doing people's taxes and you finally found something fun to do with that thing",2,"Hold out your cracker - two ounces - next"}},
{"s1_c01_uncle_jerky_022","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=4,14|mood=angry|world=building",{1,"Remember finding six bags of beef jerky under Uncle Roy's socks?",2,"I bought that jerky with my own money in Elizabethtown",3,"Before or after we all put everything on the kitchen table?",2,"Before - well, the day of",1,"And you put it on the table. Nobody wanted the socks, Roy"}},
{"s1_c01_fill_everything_023","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=1,4|mood=fear",{1,"Water's still running - fill everything, pots, vases, the kiddie pool, the crockpot",2,"The fish tank too?",1,"Fish keep what they've got, fill the cooler next, and the trash cans, rinse 'em first",3,"Why? It's working fine",1,"Because the man on channel eleven said to fill everything - and then he quit talking in the middle"}},
{"s1_c01_moldy_heel_024","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=3,10|mood=funny",{1,"Last loaf's got mold on the heel",2,"Cut around it",1,"It's on the heel and three slices in",2,"Then we've got five good slices, toast them on the burner - Mold's just flavor you didn't order"}},
{"s1_c01_house_numbers_grace_025","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=2,14|hour=16,20|mood=funny|world=road",{1,"Daddy's grace gets longer every night",2,"Tonight he prayed for every house on the street, by the house number",1,"He did two-fourteen twice",3,"Two-fourteen needs it twice, pass the beans"}},
{"s1_c01_waiting_beep_026","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|hour=19,4|mood=warm",{1,"I tried praying last night, first time since my mother's funeral",2,"How'd it go?",1,"Fine, till the end, I didn't know how to finish, I kept waiting for the beep, like a machine",2,"You say amen",1,"I know you say amen, it just felt like hanging up on somebody"}},
{"s1_c01_good_china_beads_027","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|mood=calm",{1,"Mamaw's gone around those rosary beads four times since supper",2,"Mamaw's Baptist",1,"She was Catholic till she married Papaw, she says she's getting out the good china for this",2,"Well, let her, maybe the good china gets answered quicker"}},
{"s1_c01_brother_tim_028","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,8|mood=funny",{1,"My sister says this is the Rapture, says the good ones got taken and the rest of us got left",2,"Brother Tim from the Holiness church is out watering his roses right now - I just saw him",1,"So?",2,"So if Brother Tim is still here, this ain't the Rapture - that man hasn't missed a service in forty years",3,"Maybe they took him and sent him back for the roses"}},
{"s1_c01_vbs_marquee_029","any",2,"reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|day=2,10|mood=funny",{1,"Sign out front of First Baptist still says Vacation Bible School, July twelfth to sixteenth - all children welcome",2,"Somebody oughta go pull those letters down",1,"What for? School's out, nobody's working, and everybody's praying, they got it about right"}},
{"s1_c01_dog_first_030","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=2,14|hour=19,23|mood=sad",{1,"Bedtime prayers tonight, Caleb prayed for the dog first",2,"Before his daddy?",1,"Before his daddy, then he opened his eyes real big and asked could he start over",2,"What'd you say back?",1,"Told him the Lord takes the list in any order - he closed his eyes and did it over anyway"}},
{"s1_c01_swing_set_prayer_031","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=3,14|mood=grim",{1,"You pray for them? The ones outside?",2,"Every night, every one of them was somebody's boy or somebody's mama",1,"That one by the swing set has been clawing at our back door for two days",2,"Then he gets prayed for a little louder"}},
{"s1_c01_pressed_flowers_032","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=2,14|hour=19,23|mood=sad",{1,"Papaw's Bible has flowers pressed all through it, near every other page",2,"From Mamaw's funeral spray, he dried the whole thing, one at a time",1,"If I turn the pages, the flowers crumble. I don't want to",2,"Leave it where it opens, then. He read that page enough to wear it there"}},
{"s1_c01_old_clothes_033","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=3,14|mood=sad|world=building",{1,"Is Grandpa in heaven if his body got back up?",2,"What makes you ask that, bug?",1,"'Cause if he's in heaven, who was that in the kitchen?",2,"Grandpa went to heaven Friday, the one in the kitchen was just his old clothes walking around",1,"Okay, he did hate those pants"}},
{"s1_c01_prayer_chain_door_034","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=2,10|hour=4,11|mood=warm|world=door",{1,"Church used to run a prayer chain, somebody gets sick, you call the next lady on the list",2,"Phones are out",1,"So I wrote Mrs. Hensley's name on a piece of paper and stuck it in the Carvers' screen door",2,"And?",1,"This morning there was a second name written under it - different handwriting"}},
{"s1_c01_prayer_shift_035","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=3,14|hour=20,4|mood=funny|world=building",{1,"Who's on prayer tonight?",2,"You're making a schedule for praying now?",1,"Watch is two hours - Prayer's two hours, somebody's awake either way, they might as well do both",3,"I'll take both, I can't sleep, and God's the only one in this house that doesn't shush me"}},
{"s1_c01_mutter_grace_jimmy_036","any",1,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=3,14|hour=16,20|mood=sad",{1,"Bless this food, bless these hands that fixed it",1,"Bless Jimmy, wherever he's eating supper tonight",1,"If he's eating - amen - amen, okay"}},
{"s1_c01_mutter_can_math_037","any",1,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=3,14|mood=fear",{1,"Twenty-two cans - four people, two cans a day between us",1,"That's eleven days, eleven, if nobody new comes knocking",1,"Somebody's gonna come knocking"}},
{"s1_c01_half_bar_fridge_038","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=2,14|mood=sad|world=building",{1,"Ben broke his candy bar in half and put one half in the fridge",2,"The fridge doesn't work",1,"I know, he says it's for when his dad gets home, he wrote DAD on the wrapper in marker",2,"It's gonna melt in there",1,"Then it melts"}},
{"s1_c01_found_a_noodle_039","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=4,14|mood=funny|world=hot",{1,"One can of chicken noodle, and I'm putting four cans of water in with it",2,"That's dishwater with a noodle floating in it",1,"It's hot, and it has noodles in it",3,"I got a noodle! Everybody look, I got one!"}},
{"s1_c01_gaines_pump_040","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=5,14",{1,"Mr. Gaines has a well with a hand pump on it - and a padlock",2,"Has he said anything?",1,"Two gallons a household, before noon, said it sitting on the pump with a shotgun across his lap",3,"That's more than fair, that's more than I'd do",2,"That's exactly what you'd do, and you'd charge a quarter a gallon"}},
{"s1_c01_fever_medicine_trade_041","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=3,14|mood=sad",{1,"Traded the Coles two cans of tuna for half a bottle of kids' fever medicine",2,"Half a bottle, for two cans?",1,"She cried handing it over, their little one's running a fever too",2,"Then walk her back one of the cans"}},
{"s1_c01_said_sorry_042","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=5,14|hour=20,3|mood=sad",{1,"Sam's stomach was growling so loud tonight I could hear it clear across the room",2,"Did he complain?",1,"No, he said sorry - he said sorry to me for being hungry"}},
{"s1_c01_salisbury_steak_043","any",2,"reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|day=3,10|mood=funny",{1,"Salisbury steak TV dinner - room temperature, eaten straight out of the tray",2,"How is it?",1,"Every bit as good as it was hot",2,"So, bad",1,"So bad, I'll eat yours too, if you're not gonna"}},
{"s1_c01_eightynine_mistake_044","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=3,14|mood=funny",{1,"Mamaw's cellar has jars back to nineteen eighty-seven, chow-chow, green beans, and something real dark purple",2,"What's the purple?",1,"Label says nineteen eighty-nine, and under that, in her writing, it just says mistake",2,"Put it at the very bottom of the list"}},
{"s1_c01_name_on_cap_045","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=3,14|mood=angry",{1,"You drank my Gatorade! My name was on the cap!",2,"Everything's everybody's now - Mom said so",1,"Mom meant the food, that bottle was in my own ball bag from practice",3,"It's gone, there's no more of it anywhere in this county - yelling won't put it back in the bottle"}},
{"s1_c01_sunday_school_offer_046","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=2,14|hour=4,11|mood=sad",{1,"I told God I'd go back to church - every Sunday - Wednesday nights too - Tithe the whole ten percent",2,"He answer you?",1,"Nothing, so this morning I offered to teach Sunday school - the first graders",2,"That's a big offer",1,"It's the biggest I got, I don't know what else He'd want off me"}},
{"s1_c01_hands_quit_shaking_047","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=1,14|mood=angry",{1,"Pray all you want, it hasn't stopped a single one of them yet",2,"I ain't praying for them, I'm praying so my hands quit shaking long enough to load the gun",1,"Then pray quieter",2,"No"}},
{"s1_c01_snack_at_three_048","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=3,14|mood=funny",{1,"If we had to cut back to two meals, how would you explain it to kids?",2,"The kids'll be starving by three o'clock",1,"I'd want to check what we could save for them in the afternoon",3,"What kind of snack?",1,"I don't know what we'd have, Gary. No point promising saltines before counting them"}},
{"s1_c01_mutter_shelf_recount_049","any",1,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=4,14|hour=0,5|mood=fear",{1,"Two cans of corn - tomato soup, the dented one with no label",1,"Count again, maybe there's one hiding back behind the flour",1,"No, that's it - that's everything we've got on that shelf"}},
{"s1_c01_cake_top_tier_050","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=4,12|mood=warm",{1,"The top of our wedding cake has been in that freezer since last August",2,"For the anniversary, it's next month",1,"Freezer's off - it's thawing",2,"Get two forks, we're having our anniversary early"}},
{"s1_c01_raisin_potato_salad_051","any",2,"reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|day=2,14|mood=sad",{1,"First Sunday of every month the church had the covered dish dinner - twelve kinds of potato salad",2,"Lucille Harper put raisins in hers",1,"Every month I said never again, I'd give a lot for one scoop of Lucille's raisin potato salad right now",2,"Lucille's in Florida at her sister's - she's fine, I've decided Lucille's fine"}},
{"s1_c01_buttons_for_god_052","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=2,9|mood=funny|world=building",{1,"We're having church in the living room at ten, same as always",2,"Who's preaching?",1,"Your father's reading - nobody's preaching, your father can't preach",3,"I heard that",1,"Everybody put on a shirt with buttons - God can still see this living room"}},
{"s1_c02_albums_or_food_001","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=1,6|mood=calm",{1,"You packed three photo albums and one can of Vienna sausages",2,"The sausages are for the drive",1,"Babe, those albums weigh more than the kids do",2,"You can't eat a picture, I know that, you can't go back and take one either",1,"One album - pick the one with the wedding in it"}},
{"s1_c02_weed_eater_gas_002","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=1,8|world=vehicle,road",{1,"Van's on a quarter tank - Louisville's forty miles, and that's if the road goes straight through",2,"There's the gas can in the shed",1,"That's got the two-stroke oil mixed in it, for the weed eater",2,"So the van smokes a little, everything smokes a little now"}},
{"s1_c02_fishing_license_map_003","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=2,10|world=water,road",{1,"Fella at the bait shop drew me a back way - past Otter Creek, then gravel all the way to the river road",2,"On a napkin?",1,"On the back of his fishing license, he knows every road in this county by the potholes",3,"Then why's he still sitting at the bait shop?",1,"I didn't think to ask him that"}},
{"s1_c02_front_bedroom_004","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh,seasoned|day=1,10|mood=sad|world=vehicle,building",{1,"Mama, get in the car - please",2,"I was born in the front bedroom of this house - your daddy passed in the back one, I'll wait right here",1,"Wait for what?",2,"For you all to come back, just leave me the transistor radio and the good flashlight, if that's alright"}},
{"s1_c02_bardstown_road_005","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=0,5|mood=fear",{1,"Donna called Friday night, last call that got through, she said come to Louisville, come stay with us",2,"What else did she say?",1,"That there were a lot of sirens on Bardstown Road - then the line went funny",2,"Funny how?",1,"Muffled, like somebody put a hand over it"}},
{"s1_c02_quarter_flip_006","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,10|mood=funny",{1,"Heads we go to Louisville - Tails we stay put",2,"You're flipping a quarter over our lives?",1,"We've argued six hours, that quarter's got as much sense as any of us",3,"Tails",1,"Best two out of three",2,"Give me that quarter"}},
{"s1_c02_part_in_middle_007","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=3,12|mood=grim|world=cars",{1,"You made it all the way to the bridge?",2,"To where the cars quit, two miles short of it - we got out and walked on toward the lights",1,"And?",2,"And we walked back, I'd rather skip the part in the middle, if it's all the same to you"}},
{"s1_c02_median_grass_008","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=2,9|mood=fear|world=vehicle,door,window,road",{1,"Dixie Highway's a parking lot from the Muldraugh overpass north - doors open, engines dead",2,"People still in them?",1,"Some, I walked the median, you don't look in the windows - you keep your eyes on the grass",3,"Did anybody knock on the glass at you?",1,"I said you don't look"}},
{"s1_c02_million_street_009","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,8|mood=grim|world=road",{1,"Louisville's got the big hospitals - the Guard - the airport",2,"Louisville's also got near a million people in it",1,"So?",2,"So pick a number, however many of a million you figure caught it - now picture that number all on one street"}},
{"s1_c02_elephants_010","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=2,14|mood=warm",{1,"What happens to the animals at the zoo in Louisville? The elephants?",2,"The zookeepers will look after them, sweetie",1,"What if the zookeepers turned into monsters?",2,"Then the elephants are fine, nobody is biting an elephant",1,"Oh, okay - good"}},
{"s1_c02_first_light_fridge_011","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=3,10|hour=4,9|mood=funny|world=building",{1,"We leave at first light",2,"You said that Saturday",1,"And I meant it Saturday",3,"He said it Sunday too, I wrote it on the fridge - first light, he said, first light",1,"Well, then tomorrow makes it official"}},
{"s1_c02_note_preston_highway_012","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=2,10|mood=calm",{1,"Write it big, gone to Aunt Dot's in Louisville - Preston Highway, the yellow house past the Kroger",2,"Should I put the date?",1,"The date and the time, and put that we're all okay",2,"We're not all okay",1,"Put it anyway, whoever reads that note needs to read it"}},
{"s1_c02_horn_goodbye_013","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,8|mood=angry|world=window,road",{1,"The Pattersons just pulled out laying on the horn, waving at everybody like it's a parade",2,"They're saying goodbye",1,"They're saying come on out to every one of them on this street - look out the front window",3,"They're following the horn, at least they're following it away from us"}},
{"s1_c02_blue_jeans_keys_014","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=0,4|mood=fear|world=vehicle",{1,"Where are the van keys?",2,"On the hook!",1,"They're not on the hook, there's nothing on that hook but the shed key",3,"Check your jeans from yesterday, in the hamper - the blue ones",1,"Oh thank God, oh, thank you, God"}},
{"s1_c02_hands_up_staying_015","any",4,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=2,10|hour=16,5|mood=warm",{1,"Hands up for staying put",2,"Staying",3,"Staying",4,"I'd want to go if my kids might be in Louisville. Last I heard, they were with their mother",1,"Then we'd talk about what you knew and what you'd need. Not decide the whole trip with our hands up"}},
{"s1_c02_buddy_howls_016","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=2,8|mood=funny|world=building",{1,"Every time that emergency tone comes on the TV, Buddy throws his head back and howls",2,"Turn it down",1,"I turned it down, now he howls at the little red light",3,"Only one in this house saying what we're all thinking"}},
{"s1_c02_sitting_by_017","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=2,8|mood=funny|world=window",{1,"TV still says please stand by",2,"It's said that since breakfast",1,"I've been standing by so long I had to sit by",2,"Then sit by the window, holler if anything comes up the drive"}},
{"s1_c02_crawl_one_word_018","any",3,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=2,6|hour=4,11|mood=calm",{1,"I copied down every word of the crawl on the TV - twice, in case it changed",2,"Did it?",1,"It did, this morning it said remain indoors, now it says remain in your residence",3,"Is there a difference?",1,"I don't know, somebody up there thought there was one"}},
{"s1_c02_paused_tape_019","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=1,6|mood=fear|world=vehicle,door",{1,"I taped the eleven o'clock news Friday night - watch behind the reporter, not the reporter",2,"What am I looking for?",1,"There - pause it, the man by the ambulance doors - look at what he's doing to the other man's arm",2,"Rewind it, play that again"}},
{"s1_c02_busy_signal_020","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=1,5|mood=warm",{1,"TV put a number on the screen - call for information",2,"You call it?",1,"Forty-one times - busy",2,"So forty thousand people know something we don't",1,"Or forty thousand people are listening to the same busy signal as me - that helps some, honestly"}},
{"s1_c02_saturday_shelters_021","any",2,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=2,6|mood=fear",{1,"They read off the shelters - Rosewood Elementary's on the list, that's twenty minutes",2,"When did they read that list?",1,"Saturday, I wrote it down Saturday",2,"Then that's a list of where everybody in the county went on Saturday - think on that before we drive to it"}},
{"s1_c02_boil_advisory_022","any",2,"reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|day=5,12|mood=funny|world=building",{1,"I remember a boil-water advisory coming over the radio",2,"Our stove was electric and we'd lost power",1,"Man only advised. Didn't tell us how to solve that part"}},
{"s1_c02_truck_battery_tv_023","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=5,14|world=vehicle,building,snow",{1,"Hooked the little kitchen TV to the truck battery through the inverter - ten minutes a night",2,"What's on?",1,"Snow on every channel, channel nine's got a still picture of the station sign and no sound",3,"Then save the battery",1,"Ten minutes a night, in case somebody walks in front of the sign"}},
{"s1_c02_egg_timer_sock_024","any",3,"reg=family|tmp=fresh|day=3,14|mood=funny",{1,"Radio gets fifteen minutes on the egg timer, when it dings, the radio goes off",2,"What if they're in the middle of saying something important?",1,"Then they'll say it again, they've said everything else nine times",3,"That timer dings awful loud",1,"Then put a sock on it"}},
}
